      "Implemented Fisher's discriminant ratio ($C$) as a class separability criterion combined with a stepwise feature selection scheme accounting for cross-correlation between descriptors.",
      "Applied a $k$-means clustering algorithm ($k_{mm} = 2$ or $3$) within each class for each selected descriptor to identify a 'bad cluster' with smaller descriptor values where outliers are gathered.",
      "Discarded inhibitors present in all bad clusters across all selected descriptors as outliers (concomitant feature selection and dataset trimming).",
      "Evaluated model performance and monitored feature selection progress using linear regression (solving normal equations), cross-validation ($q^2$), external validation metrics (Golbraikh and Tropsha criteria), representation entropy ($H_R$), Shannon entropy, MREG stepwise variable selection, Cerius2 PLS, and SYBYL CoMFA PLS regression."
